  "modal.title": "Isaziso",
  "modal.text": "Zivakashi ezihloniphekile! Isikhumba ngasinye kule galari siwumphumela wamahora amaningi omsebenzi. Izikhumba ezenziwe umdali wewebhusayithi zivikelwe amalungelo obunikazi: ukuzibuka kuvunyelwe, kodwa ukuzilanda, ukuzikopisha nokuzisebenzisa kwezentengiselwano kudinga isivumelwano sangaphambili. Ezinye izinto (amajazi, ukwakheka kwamabhulokhi nezitshalo, njll.) zingezabadali bazo abashiwo emibhalweni yezithombe, futhi zisetshenziswa ngokwemibandela yamalayisensi abo. Siyabonga ngokuqonda nangokwethembeka kwenu! Khumbulani ukuthi lena isevisi ye-Minecraft engekho emthethweni. Ayigunyazwanga yi-Mojang noma yi-Microsoft futhi ayixhumene nabo. Abanikazi bewebhusayithi yibo abanomthwalo wayo, hhayi i-Mojang noma i-Microsoft.",
