  "rename.guide.codes": "Esihlokweni ungasebenzisa amakhodi wokufomatha we-Minecraft: uphawu § kanye nohlamvu ngemuva kwalo. Imibala: §0–§9 kanye no-§a–§f. Izitayela: §l — okugqinsi, §o — okuncike, §n — okudwetshwe ngezansi, §m — okudwetshwe phakathi, §k — \"okufihlekile\", §r — setha kabusha konke. Ikhodi yombala isetha kabusha izitayela zangaphambilini, ngakho faka izitayela ngemuva kombala",
